	(text "D1170 is the Iasis status indicator; D1171-D1175 are targets 1-5 (GRB, 800 kHz).\nU1172 controls host orientation and HUB_RUN; reset leaves HUB_RUN high and EXT_ORIENT low.\nThe host VBUS monitor is independent of this expander and of MCU firmware.\nConfirmation is a deliberate firmware action; attachment alone does not authorize erase."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 203.2 0)
